{
    "id": "running-processes",
    "name": "Running Processes",
    "description": "View → Running Processes (or the command palette): every process that is running now, the one using the most memory first, in the preview pane, with whose it is and how it was started. It updates every three seconds while it is shown, and only shows: nothing is stopped.",
